<p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color: #666666; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for your interest in Intel® Premier Support.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNoSpacing"><br /></p>
<p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt;">We are processing your request and will inform you of our decision within 48 business hours via email notification. <br /><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNoSpacing"></p>
<p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"> <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #666666; font-size: 12pt;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #666666;">To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, please add us to your address book. </span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"> </span></p>
<p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">                                                                                                                      <img class="floating" src="https://www.intel.com/content/dam/logos/intel-logo.png" alt="Intel logo" height="42" width="64" /></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">                                                                                      </span></p>
